# Supabase credentials for the BFF (server/). Copy this file to .env and fill in your project's values
# (Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API Keys). On Render, set the same variables in the service's
# Environment settings instead of using a file.
#
# These are SERVER-ONLY. They have no VITE_ prefix on purpose: Vite never puts them in the browser bundle,
# and the browser only ever calls /api on our own server. The secret key (or the legacy service_role key)
# bypasses Row Level Security, so never rename it with a VITE_ prefix or use it in src/.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-or-service-role-key
